  "protocol": "Four untimed application-memory browser command-family observations using one retained ASCII-rich Text / TextGroup fixture, 240 spans, 2,880 initial glyphs, six phases on WebGPU and WebGL2, 30 idle frames. Main frozen oracle captured before comparison arms.",
